# Everything text is stored and checked out as LF, on every platform.
#
# This is not a style preference. `scripts/build-map-data.mjs` writes lib/geo.ts and
# lib/route-paths.ts with LF, and tests/build.test.mjs regenerates them and asserts the result is
# byte-identical to what is committed — the guarantee that a fresh clone can rebuild the map offline.
# Without this file, Git checks those files out as CRLF on Windows, the regenerated LF version differs
# on every line, and `npm test` fails on a new machine while passing on the one that generated them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
